// The docs on Cloudflare Workers: production at sqlty.jirikuncar.workers.dev, a Preview
// per pull request at pr-<number>-sqlty.jirikuncar.workers.dev (the Preview job of docs.yml).
{
  "name": "sqlty",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-11-01",
  "workers_dev": true,
  "preview_urls": true,
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./public",
    "html_handling": "auto-trailing-slash",
    "not_found_handling": "404-page"
  },
  "previews": {}
}
